The examples under this directory are derived from the XLS project.

* Each example's orig/ directory holds unmodified copies of XLS source files,
  with their license headers. orig/UPSTREAM records the repository, tag,
  commit and sha256 of every copied file.
* The SystemVerilog ports (<name>_pkg.sv), their tests (<name>_unit_test.sv),
  common/xls_std_pkg.sv (ports of DSLX standard library functions), and the
  DSLX wrappers in <name>/dslx_top/ are derived works of those files.
  gcd/dslx_top/gcd_tops.x contains a full copy of gcd.x.

